# Notify improve loop — CONTINUE UNPROMPTED (training)

When this agent touches PM email, feedback, Make, or `notify-pm`, **own the
notify improve loop**. Training contract: `improve-loops-training.mdc`.

## Mandatory loop

1. Read `qa_notify/synthetic/improve_summary_latest.json`.
2. Fix real top failures (missing to/cc, type aliases, subject casing, body).
3. Re-run: `python scripts/notify_improve_loop.py`.
4. Append lessons to `qa_notify/synthetic/training_lessons.json`.
5. Expand cases when a new notification type or Make failure appears.

## Curriculum focus

- All types: ship_confirm, quick_ship, return_to_stock, po, bulk_po, return, feedback
- Make webhook contract: `to`, `cc`, `subject`, `body`, `attachments`, `has_attachments`
- Never embed Make webhook URL in Flutter
- Keep Make scenario **active** when fixing delivery (do not leave it off)

Docs: `qa_notify/synthetic/README.md`.
